---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro"; import "../../styles/global.css";
---
<MainLayout title="Minecraft Tools" description="Minecraft Nether coordinate, XP and crafting tools.">
<section class="page-hero container"><span class="pill">GAME TOOLS</span><h1>Minecraft <span class="gradient-text">tools.</span></h1><p class="lead" style="margin:0">Quick calculators and crafting references for your blocky adventures.</p></section>
<section class="section container grid">
<a class="card" href="/tools/minecraft-nether-calculator/"><div class="card-icon">🌀</div><h3>Nether Coordinate Calculator</h3><p>Convert coordinates between the Overworld and Nether.</p><span class="card-link">Open calculator →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/tools/minecraft-xp-calculator/"><div class="card-icon">✨</div><h3>XP Calculator</h3><p>Find the experience points needed to reach a target level.</p><span class="card-link">Open calculator →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/tools/minecraft-crafting-helper/"><div class="card-icon">🧱</div><h3>Crafting Helper</h3><p>Look up a small starter collection of common recipes.</p><span class="card-link">Open helper →</span></a>
</section>
</MainLayout>
